{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܩܵܡܘܿܕܝܼ ܫܵܓ݂ܫܝܼ ܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܥܲܡܡܹ̈ܐ ܗܲܓܝܼ ܒܣܪܝܼܩܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܩܝܼܠܔ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܫܵܘܦܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܡܲܠܟܹ̈ܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܫܲܠܝܼ̈ܛܹܐ ܥܒ݂ܝܼܕ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܡܸܠܟܵܐ ܥܲܡ ܚܕܵܕܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܘܥܲܠܔ ܡܫܝܼܚܹܗ، ܒܹܐܡܵܪܵܐ:","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܩܵܛܥܲܚ ܐܸܣܘܼܪ̈ܵܝܗ‌ܝ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܪܲܦܲܚ ܡܥܲܠܲܢ ܚܲܒ݂ܠܵܝ̈ܗ‌ܝ.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܬܒ݂ܵܢܵܐ ܒܫܡܲܝܵܐ ܒܸܓܚܵܟܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܡܲܣܚܘܼܪܹܐ ܒܝܼܵܝܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܝܓܵܗ ܒܸܬ ܗܲܡܙܸܡ ܐܸܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܒܟܲܪܒܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܚܸܡܬܹܗ ܒܸܬ ܡܲܪܓܸܕ ܠܗܘܿܢ، ܒܹܐܡܵܪܵܐ:","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܐܵܢܵܐ ܡܘܼܩܸܡ ܠܝܼ ܡܲܠܟܝܼ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܨܸܗܝܘܿܢ، ܛܘܼܪܵܐ ܕܩܘܼܕܫܝܼ.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܗܲܩܹܝܢ ܒܘܼܬ ܩܵܢܘܿܢܵܐ ܕܡܵܪܝܵܐ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܡܝܼܪܹܗ ܐܸܠܝܼ: ”ܒܪܘܿܢܝܼ ܝܘܸܬ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ، ܐܵܢܵܐ ܐܸܕܝܘܿܡ ܩܵܡ ܡܲܠܸܕܸܢܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܛܠܘܿܒ ܡܸܢܝܼ ܘܒܸܬ ܝܵܗܒܹܢ ܐܸܡܘܵܬܹ̈‌ܐ ܠܝܵܪܬܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܡܘܼܠܟܘܼܟ݂ ܗܲܠܔ ܡܲܪ̈ܙܵܢܹܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"”ܒܸܬ ܬܵܒ݂ܪܹܬ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܒܩܵܛܝܼܵܐ ܕܦܪܸܙܠܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܡܵܐܢܵܐ ܕܦܲܚܵܪܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܛܵܒ݂ܚܹܬ ܠܗܘܿܢ.“","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܘܼܬ ܐܵܗܵܐ، ܝܵܐ ܡܲܠܟܹ̈ܐ، ܗܘܹܝܡܘܼܢ ܗܵܘܢܵܢܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܒܠܘܼܢ ܡܲܪܕܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ، ܝܵܐ ܕܲܝܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܐܲܪܥܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܦܠܘܿܚܘܼܢ ܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܒܙܕܘܼܥܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܦܨܘܿܚܘܼܢ ܒܪܲܬܪܲܬܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܢܫܘܿܩܘܼܢ ܠܒܪܘܿܢܵܐ ܕܠܵܐ ܟܵܪܹܒ ܘܐܵܙܠ݇ܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܠܐܲܒ݂ܕܵܢܵܐ ܓܵܘ ܐܘܼܪܚܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܒܸܬ ܠܵܒ݂ܟ݂ܵܐ ܒܓ̰ܲܠܕܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܚܸܡܬܹܗ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܘܼܒ݂ܵܐ ܠܐܵܢܝܼ ܕܫܵܩܠܝܼ ܓܵܘܣܵܐ ܒܝܼܹܗ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}